What is Microirrigation?
Microirrigation systems encompass drip, sprinkler, and subsurface irrigation methods that provide precise water application at low flow rates. The technology enables farmers to tailor moisture delivery to specific crop needs, integrate fertigation, and combine with digital sensors for automated control.
